# ESP-IDF specific build outputs
*.bin
!main/assets/*.bin
!/boards/pico/src/main/assets/ui-hanzi.bin
!/flash/bootloader.bin
!/flash/partitions.bin
!/flash/firmware.bin
!/flash/ota_data_initial.bin
!/flash/Pico-update*.bin
# Anki 分支发布的应用分区固件（供 Flash Download Tool 烧到 0x10000）
# App-partition firmware published with the Anki fork (flash at 0x10000).
!/firmware/*.bin
# 网页刷机用的三个基础部件（bootloader / 分区表 / otadata）：CI 没有构建产物，
# 但必须与本地验证过的字节完全一致，所以单独入库一份。
# / The three base parts for web flashing (bootloader / partitions / otadata). CI has no
#   build output, yet the published bytes must equal the locally verified ones, so this
#   one copy is tracked. `!/firmware/*.bin` does not cross directories.
!/firmware/anki-base/*.bin
!/flash/releases/*/bootloader.bin
!/flash/releases/*/partitions.bin
!/flash/releases/*/ota_data_initial.bin
*.elf
*.map
flasher_args.json # Generated in build directory
sdkconfig.old
sdkconfig

