# 历史上这里曾用 /flash/firmware.bin、/flash/Pico-update-*.bin 等排除「官网构建时
# 临时下载」的产物（上游认为正式 Bin 只放 Releases）。但本 fork 直接把固件包发布
# 在 flash/ 下，且上面的 !/flash/... 白名单在 git 里「最后匹配优先」——这些补丁式
# 忽略会反过来盖掉白名单，让新的 flash/Pico-update-*.bin 必须 add -f 才能入库。
# 因此这里不再忽略，改为在白名单侧一次性放行站点发布物。
# / These lines used to exclude artifacts hydrated for website builds (upstream keeps
# official binaries in Releases only). This fork publishes its bundles under flash/,
# and git applies the LAST matching pattern — so those ignores overrode the
# !/flash/... whitelists above and forced git add -f for a new
# flash/Pico-update-*.bin. Nothing is ignored here any more; the whitelists below
# allow the published site artifacts in one place.
!/flash/*.bin
!/flash/releases/*/*.bin

!flash/metalio/releases/*/bootloader.bin
!flash/metalio/releases/*/partitions.bin
!flash/metalio/releases/*/ota_data_initial.bin
# 网页刷机入口 /anki/ 的清单与 bin 是构建产物：manifest 里每个部件都记着 size 与
# sha256，每次构建都会变；入库会与真正发布的字节脱轨（rc103.01 就踩过版本化副本
# 没刷新的坑）。因此由 CI 在部署前用 tools/stage_anki_flash.py 现场生成，只把页面
# index.html 与浏览器端校验模块 integrity.js 入库。
# / The /anki/ manifest and binaries are build products: every part's size and SHA-256
#   inside the manifest changes with each build, and a committed copy drifts away from
#   the bytes that are actually deployed (the rc103.01 stale versioned copy did exactly
#   that). CI regenerates them with tools/stage_anki_flash.py before deploying; only the
#   page itself (index.html) and its browser-side verifier (integrity.js) are tracked.
/flash/anki/*.bin
/flash/anki/manifest.json
# 可回退版本的整包同样是构建产物（每版四件套由 firmware/ 里入库的镜像现场生成）：
# 只把版本目录 flash/anki/releases.json 入库，releases/ 下的 bin 与 manifest 由部署生成。
# The rollback bundles are build products too (each is generated from the committed
# firmware/ images); only the catalog flash/anki/releases.json is tracked.
/flash/anki/releases/
sdkconfig.bak*
sdkconfig.bak-*
# 每块板各一份 sdkconfig（board.cmake 里写的是 sdkconfig.<board>）。
# / One sdkconfig per board; board.cmake points at sdkconfig.<board>.
/sdkconfig.pico
/sdkconfig.metalio47
/build-*/
# 注意：上游在私有构建仓库里用 /flash/ 忽略整个站点；本 fork 在 flash/ 下发布
# 固件包，已在上方用 !/flash/... 白名单逐条放行。整目录忽略会让白名单全部失效
# （git 不会在已排除的目录里再包含文件），故此处不采用该行。
# Note: upstream's private build repo ignores the whole /flash/ site. This fork
# publishes firmware bundles under flash/ and whitelists them file by file
# above; excluding the directory would void every one of those negations (git
# never re-includes inside an excluded directory), so that line is not taken.

# 两板内建扩展字库。/ Expanded embedded assets for both boards.
!boards/metalio47/src/main/assets/builtin.ttf
!boards/metalio47/src/main/assets/ui-hanzi.bin
